          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Charlotte's Web: Wilbur and Friends is a game based on the children's movie Charlotte's Web. In comparison to the handheld version this is not a platformer, but a minigame collection aimed at children. The player can freely switch between four backgrounds (a barn, a countryside, the Country Fair and a junkyard) and choose the mini games by clicking on the assigned portion of the screen. Sometimes the player unlocks new minigames or still photos from the movie when beating a part of a mini game.",
          "source": "igdb",
